==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Bokoblin Fangs are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by [[Bokoblin]]s and [[Stalkoblin]]s upon defeat. They are worn down and dull, but the material is hard.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Bokoblin Fangs can be used with other ingredients to [[Cooking|Cook]] [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be sold to [[Kilton]] at [[Fang and Bone]] for [[Mon]]. The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] can use Bokoblin Fangs as an ingredient for [[Light Yellow Dye]].

Bokoblin Fangs are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
{{Material Armors|BotW|Bokoblin Fang}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
Bokoblin Fangs are dropped by [[Bokoblin]]s upon their defeat.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

Bokoblin Fangs are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Bokoblin Fang}}

